OL,3,AAround 2,000 fall ill in Indonesia
OL,4,Aafter eating free school meals
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, as well as being the suspected
OL,7,Fsource of a string of mass food
OL,8,Fpoisonings, the programme has been
OL,9,Fdogged by allegations of corruption and
OL,10,Fcriticism of its cost.
